WEBVTT

00:08:28.649 --> 00:08:30.116
a strip club;

00:08:30.958 --> 00:08:35.275
every single person's public movements,
habits and associations

00:08:35.299 --> 00:08:36.934
documented and catalogued,

00:08:36.958 --> 00:08:39.323
not on one day, but on every day,

00:08:39.347 --> 00:08:41.292
merely with the push of a button.

00:08:42.276 --> 00:08:45.418
This kind of totalizing mass surveillance

00:08:45.442 --> 00:08:48.474
fundamentally threatens
what it means to live in a free society.

00:08:48.498 --> 00:08:51.227
Our freedom of speech,
freedom of association,

00:08:51.251 --> 00:08:52.586
freedom of religion,

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:53.863
freedom of the press,

00:08:53.887 --> 00:08:55.101
our privacy,

00:08:55.125 --> 00:08:56.925
our right to be left alone.

00:08:58.467 --> 00:08:59.927
You may be thinking,

00:08:59.951 --> 00:09:03.286
"OK, come on, but there are tons
of ways the government can spy on us."